# Madame Web, Clairvoyant {4}{U}{U}: "You may cast Spider spells and noncreature spells from the top of your library" (CR 601.3). On
# turn 1 Bot1 pays for her with Black Lotus and three Moxen, then casts Mox Emerald (a noncreature) off the top; the Ornithopter now on
# top is a creature and no Spider, so it may not be cast there. It is drawn on turn 3, and Masked Meower (a Spider creature) is cast
# off the top with Mox Ruby. "Whenever you attack, you may mill a card" (CR 701.17a): Madame Web attacks and Bot1 accepts, the Island
# that was on top goes to the graveyard beside the spent Lotus.

